{
  "run_id": "PMC11433250__broad__web_text_4k_b_o3mini__s1",
  "auditor": "trapi:gpt-5.6-sol_2026-07-09",
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Incorporating molybdenum into a boride coating will improve its resistance to molten-aluminum corrosion.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10003814::web::004::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intervention can be implemented by adding a low concentration of molybdenum during powder-pack boriding.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Approximately 660°C represents typical hot-dip aluminum-plating exposure conditions.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Keeping molybdenum within an optimal concentration range will avoid excessive secondary-phase formation.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Molybdenum addition will produce a mixed boride/Mo-oxide surface layer.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10003814::web::004::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The mixed surface layer will reduce the driving force for aluminum attack.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The mixed surface layer will limit galvanic interactions.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Molybdenum enhances the passivation capacity of the boride coating.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10003814::web::004::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Molybdenum promotes formation of a protective surface film.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10003814::web::004::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The protective film will impede attack by molten aluminum.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10003814::web::004::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The protective film will minimize galvanic corrosion.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Mo-containing coating will exhibit lower corrosion current density than a Mo-free boride coating processed and exposed under the same conditions.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10003814::web::004::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Mo-containing coating will exhibit less weight loss than the Mo-free baseline during molten-aluminum exposure.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10003814::web::004::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Excessive molybdenum may form unwanted secondary phases that negate the corrosion-resistance benefit.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The improvement will remain relevant only within the temperature and exposure-time conditions typical of hot-dip aluminum plating.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    }
